# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Windows checkouts otherwise store CRLF, which breaks a container build (a
# Dockerfile line ending in \r becomes part of the command) and any shell script
# copied into a Linux image. The working tree gets LF everywhere, which every
# editor on every platform handles.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
